# NEG (stage-1b #2): a bare TYPE NAME as a match scrutinee is a check-time
# reject (E_TypeInValuePosition). Before the reject this type-checked CLEAN and
# SIGSEGV'd at runtime with no output — worse, the diagnostic chain for
# `match direction:` (undefined name) suggested the type name, LEADING users
# here (book-audit #1's projected give-up point). A type is not a value.
enum Direction:
    North()
    South()

void main():
    match Direction:
        case Direction.North():
            print(1)
        else:
            print(2)
